# beard/long: Long beard: full on the cheeks and jaw, falling in lit locks to the chest and tapering to a point; the mouth shows
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the head box (STYLE_P2 21; the outline covers the widest jaw). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role beard long
layer beard
anchor head
keys rest

# (LADDER-HEAD alloys i3, i3/src/beard_long.py) the mouth shows through a two-pixel gap under the moustache (D) and at
# the beard's front (R / L); one lit lock (hair 4 over 3) runs down it, so a near-black beard reads as hair, never a hole
view D key rest origin 0 0
